  m_text: 'Controls:

    W - Move Forwards

    A - Move Left

    S - Move Backwards

    D
    - Move Right

    Space Bar - Jump

    1/2 - Change weapons (assuming you have
    2 weapons)

    Left Mouse Button - Shoots the gun

    R - Reloads the Gun

    E
    - Interact with certain items (pickup gun, buy gun)

    Q - Drop Gun

'
